@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/unidades

### Cadastrar
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Blumenau","sigla":"BNU"}

### Listar
GET {{baseUrl}}?nome=blu&page=0&size=20&sort=nome,asc

### Buscar
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### Atualizar nome
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome":"Blumenau Centro"}
